## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (1)
- `GET /proofing/v2/initialize` — Initialize the proofing service.

### Data Read (7)
- `GET /_zcl/zcal/{zcalId}` — Retrieve details for a specific calendar item.
- `GET /biz/getHamburgerMenu.do` — Retrieve the user's hamburger menu options.
- `GET /zm/{zmId}` — Retrieve details for a specific Zoho Mail item.
- `GET /zm/zc/api/v1/accounts` — Retrieve account information.
- `GET /zm/zc/new/jsp/loaded.jsp` — Check if the new Zoho Mail UI is loaded.
- `GET /zmc/getContactsAlias.do` — Get contact aliases for a user.
- `POST /zmc/getContactsAlias.do` — Search for contact aliases.

### Data Write (1)
- `POST /zm/{zmId}` — Update a specific Zoho Mail item.

### Media (1)
- `GET /zmail-public/static/transient/{transientId}` — Download a transient media file.

### Realtime (1)
- `GET /_chat/{_chatId}` — Access a specific chat session.

### Config (3)
- `GET /calendar/external-libs/ext-libs-map.json` — Get calendar external library mappings.
- `GET /zm/edisc/api/user/ediscovery/client/config` — Get eDiscovery client configuration.
- `GET /zm/zc/api/v1/accounts/org/preferences` — Retrieve organization preferences.

### Core API (2)
- `GET /integPlatform/integAction.do` — Trigger an action within the Zoho Mail platform.
- `POST /biz/bizApi.do` — Execute a business-related API call.

